```console
$ redkiln catalog --help
Read the activity catalog

Usage: redkiln catalog [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>

Commands:
  search  Find activities whose declared keywords match

Options:
  -C <PATH>   Act on the repository at this path instead of the working directory
  -h, --help  Print help

```

```console
$ redkiln catalog search --help
Find activities whose declared keywords match

Usage: redkiln catalog search [OPTIONS] <QUERY>

Arguments:
  <QUERY>  What to look for

Options:
  -C <PATH>   Act on the repository at this path instead of the working directory
  -h, --help  Print help

```
